Thank you for contributing! Create a pull request and I will review it to include in the project.

Run `node scripts/build.js` after changing questions, tasks, or `src/checklist.template.html`, and commit the generated `checklist.html` and `checklist.txt` files.

Run the tests before opening a pull request:

```bash
node --test tests/checklist.test.js tests/build.test.js
```

Node.js 18 or newer is required. The published pages are static, so opening one does not run the build.
